| Dashboard.vue (over threshold) | 11 | 21 | 18 | 27 | 2 | `v-for` L15:29 +3, `v-if` L16:22 +4, `conditional` L16:52 +5 |
| DataTable.vue | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 0 | `v-for` L7:23 +1, `v-for` L8:28 +2, `logical` L9:58 +1 |
| StatusBadge.vue | 3 | 2 | 3 | 2 | 0 | `conditional` L6:17 +1, `conditional` L6:43 +1 |
